Subject: [PATCH] Adapt collection and trigger callbacks without changing helpers

Collection callbacks return void and receive both item and user data.
Keep workspace commits and widget updates available with their original
direct-call and source-function types, and route collections through
proper GFunc adapters. Trigger callbacks similarly need their store
argument and void return. Retain one stable trigger adapter identity for
both registration and removal. Preserve tray item construction results
for direct callers while ignoring them through correctly typed listener
and collection adapters. No protocol or widget feature is disabled.

